# Canonical sibling-repo and tool pins — the single source (owner decision
# 2026-11-18, relayed via sieve: committed pin files so CI path classes
# have one hand input per sibling).
#
# The workflow env blocks carry copies of these values because GitHub
# Actions cannot read a repo file at workflow-env level; the Script
# portability job fails if any copy diverges from this file. Bump HERE
# first, then the copies, in one PR.
#
# The STPA federation job's relay checkout (ci.yml, rivet-validate) stays
# deliberately UNPINNED at ref: main — a live external is its guarantee.
